+        <article class="service-card"><span class="service-icon"><svg class="line"><use href="#tooth"/></svg></span><span class="service-number">03</span><h3>口腔与牙科</h3><p>照顾每一颗小牙齿，让吃饭、玩耍和亲近都更自在。</p><div class="tags"><span>口腔检查</span><span>洁牙护理</span></div><a href="#contact">咨询就诊 <svg class="icon line"><use href="#arrow"/></svg></a></article>
+        <article class="service-card"><span class="service-icon"><svg class="line"><use href="#shield"/></svg></span><span class="service-number">04</span><h3>预防与健康管理</h3><p>把关心放在生病之前，为不同年龄定制健康守护计划。</p><div class="tags"><span>疫苗驱虫</span><span>年度体检</span></div><a href="#contact">咨询就诊 <svg class="icon line"><use href="#arrow"/></svg></a></article>
+      </div>
+    </section>
+
+    <section id="doctors" class="team-section">
+      <div class="wrap section"><div class="section-top"><div><div class="eyebrow">OUR PEOPLE / 医生团队</div><h2>专业的双手，柔软的心。</h2></div><p>是认真负责的医生，<br>也是懂你、懂它的爱宠伙伴。</p></div>
