+          <article class="doctor-card"><div class="doctor-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622253692010-333f2da6031d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=750&q=85" alt="医生团队示意照片" loading="lazy"><span>外科诊疗</span></div><div class="doctor-info"><div><h3>陈医生</h3><span>外科 · 口腔科</span></div><p>“每一个细节，都关乎它的安心。”</p><div class="doctor-focus">关注方向 <span>软组织外科 / 口腔健康</span></div></div></article>
+          <article class="doctor-card"><div class="doctor-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594824476967-48c8b964273f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=750&q=85" alt="医生团队示意照片" loading="lazy"><span>健康管理</span></div><div class="doctor-info"><div><h3>许医生</h3><span>预防保健 · 全科</span></div><p>“愿每次见面，都是健康的模样。”</p><div class="doctor-focus">关注方向 <span>幼宠养护 / 老年宠物保健</span></div></div></article>
